Component	Requirement
Docker	Docker Desktop
Kubernetes	Local cluster enabled
kubectl	Compatible with cluster version
Container image	Nginx 1.27 initially
YAML manifests	Deployment, Service, ConfigMap
Bash	For automation script
Browser	For NodePort verification
Python packages	None

Option A — Execute manually
Run from the Experiment 8 folder:

# Check Kubernetes
kubectl config current-context
kubectl get nodes

# Create resources
kubectl apply -f configmap.yaml
kubectl apply -f deployment.yaml
kubectl apply -f service.yaml

# Verify
kubectl rollout status deployment/nginx-deployment
kubectl get deployments
kubectl get pods
kubectl get services

# Scale up
kubectl scale deployment nginx-deployment --replicas=5

# Scale down
kubectl scale deployment nginx-deployment --replicas=2

# Rolling update
kubectl set image deployment/nginx-deployment nginx=nginx:1.28
kubectl rollout status deployment/nginx-deployment

# Rollback
kubectl rollout undo deployment/nginx-deployment
kubectl rollout status deployment/nginx-deployment

Option B — Execute automation script
On Ubuntu, WSL, or Git Bash with access to Docker Desktop's Kubernetes context:


chmod +x kubernetes_commands.sh
./kubernetes_commands.sh
